e the judge.","tier":1},{"id":2008,"name":"5 Spread","pluralName":"5 Spreads","shortName":"5S's","symbol":732,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires 5 bullets in 5 directions.","flavor":"The 5 Spread makes aiming a thing of the past.  Just point anywhere and hold the mouse button, the screen will be filled with bullets going everywhere.","tier":2},{"id":2009,"name":"Pierce Cannon","pluralName":"Pierce Cannons","shortName":"PC's","symbol":717,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 5","summary":"Slow refire rate, but the bullets can pass through multiple enemies.","flavor":"Unstoppable AND unpoppable. 'Nuff said.","tier":5},{"id":2010,"name":"Exploding Pierce Cannon","pluralName":"Exploding Pierce Cannons","shortName":"EPC's","symbol":716,"gp":5,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 15","summary":"Fires bullets that pass through enemies, exploding on each impact.","flavor":"Making your bullets explode on impact seems like such a good idea, you'd wonder why every weapon didn't do it.","tier":6},{"id":2011,"name":"Leech Cannon","pluralName":"Leech Cannons","shortName":"LC's","symbol":723,"gp":4,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 2","summary":"Fires bullets that give you life whenever they damage the enemy.","flavor":"The Leech Cannon believes health points are something to be shared, mostly when those health points belong to other tanks.  He's so greedy.","tier":5},{"id":2012,"name":"Bullet Buster","pluralName":"Bullet Busters","shortName":"BB's","symbol":727,"gp":1,"bp":3,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Deflects enemy bullets.","summary":"Enemy bullets stick to BB shells, allowing you to push them away from yourself.","flavor":"Bullet Buster is a lover, not a fighter.  Says Bullet Buster: \"We're just a bunch of bubbles anyways, what's with all the violence?\"","tier":3},{"id":2014,"name":"Mega Cannon","pluralName":"Mega Cannons","sh