ones under your control.","flavor":"Something about the Drone Converter just makes enemy drones want to die for you instead of their past master.  Not sure why they feel the need to kamikaze in the first place.","tier":6},{"id":3007,"name":"Ally Bay: Swarm","pluralName":"Ally Bays: Swarm","shortName":"AB:S's","symbol":712,"gp":2,"bp":1,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Ally Stats: 15 HP, 1 Damage per shot.","summary":"Spawns allies that will fight for you.","flavor":"You know what's more fun than blowing up tanks by yourself?  Blowing them up with friends!  And with the Ally Bay, you can buy some friends! You'll be so popular!","tier":3},{"id":3008,"name":"Massive Cannon","pluralName":"Massive Cannons","shortName":"MC's","symbol":721,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":5,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 100","summary":"A massive weapon that can obliterate enemies.","flavor":"This is the gun all other Bubble Tanks weapons aspire to be.","tier":4},{"id":3009,"name":"Seekers","pluralName":"Seekers","shortName":"SC's","symbol":1825,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 10","summary":"Fires seekers which hunt enemies.","flavor":"These little guys can smell your fear.","tier":2},{"id":3010,"name":"Shield","pluralName":"Shield","shortName":"SD's","symbol":1823,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":true,"damageText":"Special: Brief invulnerability.","summary":"Allows you to become invincible for a short time.","flavor":"Ha ha! You can't hit me!","tier":2},{"id":3011,"name":"Teleport Before","pluralName":"Teleport Befores","shortName":"TPB's","symbol":1821,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Special: Teleports","summary":"Teleports to mouse location before executing weapon fires.","flavor":"The Teleport Before jumps the gun and gets things done.","tier":4},{"id":3012,"name":"Teleport After","pluralName":"Teleport Afters","shortName":"TPA's","symbol":1829,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Special: Teleports","summary":"Teleports to mouse location after executing weapon fires.","flavor":"The Teleport After allows all other secondary weapons to finish their business before making the leap.  It's rude to interrupt.","tier":4},{"id":3013,"name":"Doomsday Infector","pluralName":"Doomsday Infectors","shortName":"DDI's","symbol":32,"gp":4,"bp":3,"classCost":4,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 1/sec/Seeker","summary":"Infects enemies, dealing damage over time. Infected enemies spawn 2 more Infectors upon death.","flavor":"This weapon breaks every biological warfare treaty ever written.","tier":6},{"id":3014,"name":"Bubble Whip","pluralName":"Bubble Whips","shortName":"BW's","symbol":2037,"gp":4,"bp":2,"classCost":2,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 30","summary":"Short-range, 360 degree attack.","flavor":"Now you can whip the enemy tanks literally AND figuratively!","tier":5},{"id":3015,"name":"Rocket Launcher","pluralName":"Rocket Launchers","shortName":"RL's","symbol":2179,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 4 per Rocket","summary":"Fires ten rockets.","flavor":"Psew! Psew! PsewPsewPsew! WHOOSH... KA-BOOOOM!","tier":3},{"id":3016,"name":"Ally Bay: Mine Layer","pluralName":"Ally Bays: Mine Layer","shortName":"AB:ML's","symbol":2183,"gp":3,"bp":1,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Ally Stats: 15 HP, 3 Damage per mine.","summary":"Spawns allies that will lay mines for you.","flavor":"Laying mines is a very tedious task. That's why you should convince your friends to do it for you! Just make sure they tell you where they put them.","tier":3},{"id":3017,"name":"Apocalypse Cannon","pluralName":"Apocalypse Cannons","shortName":"AC's","symbol":2039,"gp":9,"bp":6,"classCost":6,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Destroys the Bubblefield","summary":"Fires a bullet that destroys the Bubblefield when it reaches the boundary.","flavor":"Your enemies better inform everyone they know of their impending doom when this gun is fired.","tier":6},{"id":5001,"name":"Radar","pluralName":"Radars","shortName":"R's","symbol":1994,"gp":1,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Radar","summary":"Points out enemies that are off screen.","flavor":"Shouldn't it be called 'Sonar'?","tier":3},{"id":5002,"name":"Health Readout","pluralName":"Health Readouts","shortName":"HR's","symbol":36,"gp":1,"bp":1,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Health Readout","summary":"Displays healthbars for all enemies.","flavor":"We see your weakness.","tier":3},{"id":5003,"name":"Auto Cannon","pluralName":"Auto Cannons","shortName":"AC's","symbol":1835,"gp":1,"bp":1,"classCost":5,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1","summary":"Basic Cannon that auto-targets and fires.","flavor":"If you want something done right, let another gun do it.","tier":4},{"id":5004,"name":"Seeker Flak","pluralName":"Seeker Flaks","shortName":"SF's","symbol":30,"gp":1,"bp":1,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Area Damage: 2","summary":"Targets enemy seeker missiles with short-range bursts.","flavor":"You seek me, I seek you.","tier":4},{"id":5005,"name":"Forcefield","pluralName":"Forcefields","shortName":"FF's","symbol":38,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Protects avatar from damage","summary":"Blocks 5 enemy bullets before going down for 10 seconds. Recharges 1 deflection every second when active.","flavor":"Dodging bullets is now optional.","tier":4},{"id":5006,"name":"Orbital Seekers","pluralName":"Orbital Seekers","shortName":"OS's","symbol":47,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 7 per Seeker","summary":"Spawns orbiting seeking missles around you.","flavor":"Round and round they go, what they'll hit knowbody knows. Says Orbital Seeker: \"We'll just hang here should you need us\"","tier":6},{"id":4001,"name":"Basic Cannon","pluralName":"Basic Cannons","shortName":"BC's","symbol":711,"gp":1,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1","summary":"Your standard enemy weapon.","flavor":"This is the standard gun on most bad guys. Looks simple, but when facing a few enemies with this weapon it can get tough quick.","tier":0},{"id":4002,"name":"Seekers","pluralName":"Seekers","shortName":"S's","symbol":702,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2","summary":"Emits drones which will seek out the target and explode upon impact.","flavor":"Bubblefields don't offer many good hiding places.  If you're still alive, seekers will find you to put an end to that.","tier":0},{"id":4003,"name":"Enemy Spawner","pluralName":"EnemySpawners","shortName":"ES's","symbol":704,"gp":3,"bp":8,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Spawns enemies.","summary":"Creates small fighter enemies.","flavor":"Taking up the family business of attacking tanks is fine and good, but Enemy Spawner would love to have at least one kid be a doctor.","tier":0},{"id":4004,"name":"3 Spread","pluralName":"3 Spreads","shortName":"3S's","symbol":706,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires 3 bullets in 3 directions.","flavor":"Getting away from 3 Spread can be difficult.  Me?  I've moved out of town and changed my name.  You can't ever be too safe.","tier":0},{"id":4005,"name":"3 Parallel","pluralName":"3 Parallels","shortName":"3P's","symbol":705,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per bullet","summary":"Fires 3 bullets side by side.","flavor":"This weapon is great for kids not ready for the 5 Parallel experience yet.","tier":0},{"id":4006,"name":"5 Parallel","pluralName":"5 Parallels","shortName":"5P's","symbol":707,"gp":4,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per bullet","summary":"Fires 5 bullets side by side.","flavor":"It took 7 Hero Interactive interns to decide that gluing 5 basic cannons side by side was going to be awesome.","tier":0},{"id":4007,"name":"5 Spread","pluralName":"5 Spreads","shortName":"5S's","symbol":708,"gp":6,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires 5 bullets in 5 directions.","flavor":"Some critics wonder why we never went further to create the 7 Spread. You're looking into the future, but I'm afrad the technology for 7 Spread simply doesn't exist yet.","tier":0},{"id":4008,"name":"360 Spread","pluralName":"360 Spreads","shortName":"360S's","symbol":709,"gp":4,"bp":4,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires bullets in 360 degrees.","flavor":"Don't hate on the 360's general lack of aiming skill. 4 out of 5 dentists agree: this gun is going to hit you.","tier":0},{"id":4009,"name":"Mine Dropper","pluralName":"Mine Droppers","shortName":"MD's","symbol":691,"gp":1,"bp":5,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 10","summary":"Drops immobile mines.","flavor":"Most bullets are wasted when they miss their target. Mines have decided to wait, sit still, and contemplate their existence until you hit them.","tier":0},{"id":4010,"name":"Orbital Seeker","pluralName":"Orbital Seekers","shortName":"OS's","symbol":690,"gp":6,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per Seeker","summary":"Spawns orbiting seeker missles around the enemy.","flavor":"Round and round they go, what they'll hit knowbody knows. Says Orbital Seeker: \"We'll just hang here should you need us.\"","tier":0},{"id":4011,"name":"Sticky Gun","pluralName":"Sticky Guns","shortName":"SG's","symbol":692,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Slows target.","summary":"Fires sticky bullets which briefly slow down the player's tank.","flavor":"What makes these bullets so sticky?  You don't wanna know.","tier":0},{"id":4012,"name":"Sapper Drone","pluralName":"Sapper Drones","shortName":"SD's","symbol":693,"gp":4,"bp":5,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 3 / 2","summary":"These drones seek out the player's tank, damage it, then return a portion of life to their creator.","flavor":"The neighborhood has really gotten rough since Sapper Drones came to town. Says the Sapper: \"Hey your life looks good. Can I hold it?\"","tier":0},{"id":4013,"name":"Seeker Carrier","pluralName":"Seeker Carriers","shortName":"SC's","symbol":696,"gp":1,"bp":4,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per Drone (6 Drones)","summary":"Pops and releases Seeker Drones when shot by player.","flavor":"We've always wondered what sort of dark little secrets were inside of those big yellow bubbles. \"Shoot it.  You know you want to.\" says the Carrier.","tier":0},{"id":4015,"name":"Rotating Machine Gun","pluralName":"Rotating Machine Guns","shortName":"RMG's","symbol":701,"gp":7,"bp":5,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 4 per bullet","summary":"Shoots many powerful bullets in a circle.","flavor":"Don't mock the fact that this weapon freaks out and shoots everywhere, this is the gun that makes many BT3 players break down and cry.","tier":0},{"id":4016,"name":"Heavy Cannon","pluralName":"Heavy Cannons","shortName":"HC's","symbol":1719,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 4","summary":"Fires bigger, slower, more damaging bullets.","flavor":"Making more destructive bubble weapons is a careful and precise science few can comprehend.  This gun shoots bigger bullets!","tier":0},{"id":4017,"name":"Machine Gun","pluralName":"Machine Guns","shortName":"MG's","symbol":25,"gp":6,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires many bullets in rapid succession.","flavor":"The Machine Gun just realized that if you keep holding down the trigger, the bullets keep flying out.  I hope he keeps this secret to himself.","tier":0},{"id":4018,"name":"Ink Gun","pluralName":"Ink Guns","shortName":"IG's","symbol":44,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Inks player's screen","summary":"Fires ink bullets that temporarily obstruct the player's view.","flavor":"This gun took a few lessons from its friend, the squid.","tier":0},{"id":4019,"name":"Spin-Fire","pluralName":"Spin-Fires","shortName":"SPN's","symbol":2214,"gp":8,"bp":3,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: lg bullet: 3, sm bullet: 1","summary":"Fires one large bullet that then fires lots of smaller bullets.","flavor":"This bullet parts the seas with destruction!","tier":0},{"id":4020,"name":"Rocket Launcher","pluralName":"Rocket Launchers","shortName":"RL's","symbol":2180,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 3 per Rocket","summary":"Fires ten rockets.","flavor":"You might be able to dodge nine rockets, but ten? Psshhhh.","tier":0},{"id":4021,"name":"Seeker Mine Dropper","pluralName":"Seeker Mine Droppers","shortName":"SMD's","symbol":2181,"gp":2,"bp":5,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 6","summary":"Drops camouflaged mines that gravitate toward the player's tank when it gets near.","flavor":"If the regular mines had the right idea, these things are the Einsteins of the bullet world.","tier":0},{"id":4022,"name":"Seeker Mine Pod","pluralName":"Seeker Mine Pods","shortName":"SMP's","symbol":35,"gp":1,"bp":5,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 6","summary":"When tank is destroyed, spawns camouflaged mines that gravitate toward the player's tank when it gets near.","flavor":"If the regular mines had the right idea, these things are the Einsteins of the bullet world.","tier":0},{"id":4023,"name":"Neutralizer","pluralName":"Neutralizers","shortName":"NZ's","symbol":2215,"gp":6,"bp":4,"classCost":5,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Neutralizes AC Bullet","summary":"If an Apocalypse Cannon is fired, this weapon will emit a blast that neutralizes its effect.","flavor":"It's like the antacid of the bubblefield world.","tier":0},{"id":4024,"name":"Ripple Generator","pluralName":"Ripple Generators","shortName":"RPL's","symbol":2219,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Special: Repels nearby tanks","summary":"Pushes tanks away. The smaller the tank the further they go.","flavor":"This is my bubble field! You get outta here!","tier":0},{"id":4025,"name":"Jamming Gun","pluralName":"Jamming Guns","shortName":"JG's","symbol":2227,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Jams target's weapons.","summary":"Fires jamming bullets that briefly prevent the player's tank from firing its weapons.","flavor":"Haha, look at them stare at you in confusion as they try to keep firing.","tier":0},{"id":4026,"name":"Spike","pluralName":"Spikes","shortName":"SPK's","symbol":2229,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 3","summary":"Damages and knocks back any opposing tank that collides with it.","flavor":"Can't touch this. Well, actually you can, but we don't recommend it.","tier":0},{"id":4032,"name":"Shield Turrets","pluralName":"Shield Turrets","shortName":"ShT's","symbol":2451,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Builds Shield Generators","summary":"Builds turrets that protect the tank from damage.","flavor":"\"Haha, you can't hurt- HEY! DON'T TOUCH THAT!!\"","tier":0},{"id":6001,"name":"Aggressor","pluralName":"Aggressors","shortName":"AG's","symbol":2000,"gp":0,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Aggressive","summary":"Causes the enemy to seek out the player's Bubble Tank.","flavor":"CHAAAAARRRRRGGEE!!","tier":0},{"id":6002,"name":"Healer","pluralName":"Healers","shortName":"H's","symbol":2001,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Heals other enemies","summary":"Allows the enemy to heal other enemies.","flavor":"MEDIC!","tier":0},{"id":6003,"name":"Skittish","pluralName":"Skittishes","shortName":"SK's","symbol":43,"gp":0,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Skittish","summary":"Causes the enemy to avoid the player's Bubble Tank.","flavor":"Fear? Or strategy? You decide.","tier":0},{"id":6004,"name":"Phasing","pluralName":"Phasings","shortName":"PH's","symbol":2222,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Tank phases in and out","summary":"Causes the enemy to alternate between visible and invisible.","flavor":"Now you see him, now you don't! Oh wait, there he is.","tier":0},{"id":6005,"name":"Wall Flower","pluralName":"Wall Flowers","shortName":"WF's","symbol":2230,"gp":0,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Circles Bubblefield","summary":"The tank will circle the edge of the bubblefield.","flavor":"You make me dizzy...","tier":0},{"id":7001,"name":"Ally Auto Cannon","pluralName":"Ally Auto Cannons","shortName":"AAC's","symbol":2255,"gp":1,"bp":1,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1","summary":"Basic Cannon that auto targets and fires.","flavor":"If you want something done right, let another gun do it.","tier":0}]

